314	     * The owner's membership number, formatted {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'} where {@code YY} is
315	     * the last two digits of the {@link #getFiscalYear() fiscal year} of the registration date
316	     * (e.g. {@code 'NSW-1A2B3C4D-M26'}). Derived from the owner's own customer code and registration
317	     * date; {@code null} when either is absent.
318	     *
319	     * @return the membership number, or {@code null} when it cannot be derived
320	     */
321	    public String getMembershipNumber() {
322	        if (this.customerCode == null || this.registrationDate == null) {
323	            return null;
324	        }
